OL,3,GNEWSATwo teenagers ordained as Church
OL,4,Aof Scotland elders
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers at a parish in the east
OL,7,Fend of Glasgow have become the youngest
OL,8,Fpeople in the recent history of the
OL,9,FChurch of Scotland to be appointed as
OL,10,Fchurch elders.
OL,12,FErica Matteo and Luke Anderson - both
OL,13,F19 - were ordained as elders at a
OL,14,Fspecial service in Sandyhills Parish
OL,15,FChurch, Baillieston, and are now part
OL,16,Fof the Kirk Session.
OL,18,FThat means they will be responsible for
OL,19,Fimplementing the instructions of the
OL,20,FChurch's General Assembly and making
OL,21,Fsure the Sandyhills congregation
OL,22,Fadheres to them.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
