OL,3,GNEWSATwo teenagers ordained as Church
OL,4,Aof Scotland elders
OL,5,
OL,6,FSandyhills minister Rev Norman Afrin
OL,7,Fsaid the duo carry "maturity and
OL,8,Fwisdom", despite still being teenagers.
